            <div xml:id="m-d81e382f-58ed-4c7a-b2ad-483a59760a36">
              <lg xml:id="m-ad68b708-b0ee-444f-a26a-b1eccae18a10">
                <l xml:id="m-83b6ba4e-7939-4622-9665-55c3606f402e" facs="#m-02be9ea4-4af0-4b01-9c2f-be50a2c8a083" label="text-like">Common of a Confessor not a Bishop. Vespers. 1195</l><l xml:id="m-0e5a0477-03b0-4a46-a50d-7af5f4f0db57" facs="#m-d7024d6e-1305-421f-82ad-6885f5283f88" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-9e2d13ca-cbba-40ec-806b-a84cef8fa2b8" facs="#m-9c096a41-2dcb-4ccf-b94d-99cef4769fd0" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Sérve bóne. p. 1196. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-06c65eec-99ce-4c55-9565-8231988d3219" facs="#m-9383fb4d-3e2a-45b4-88bc-6200c9050932" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-5435b44d-7f45-4351-891e-58915433f58b" facs="#m-fac91936-9c73-41b2-b602-519a748cb13c" label="ambiguous">Sap. 10. b.</l><l xml:id="m-a504b486-082d-4e57-b425-7e7c62dd7492" facs="#m-40317e59-a4f7-46f0-b26e-351caca0daab" label="lyrics-like">IUstum dedúxit Dóminus per vias rum:“honestávit illum in labóri¬</l><l xml:id="m-24e8d543-f2e0-4704-8b6e-7a2c0774b7b4" facs="#m-e10cc4fc-70a4-43e4-8da2-0c813f12646b" label="lyrics-like">Cl rectas, f et osténdit illi regnum bus, et complévit labóres illius.</l><l xml:id="m-f5081abc-378c-43e6-aed0-b67ff38dd734" facs="#m-2736f3bc-47d1-427c-98cc-9ad993cbab48" label="lyrics-like">Dei, et dedit illi sciéntiam sanctó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6db4c383-72ee-4305-9106-c95990aa4311" facs="#m-ff97e3dc-e7ba-41ce-b128-43469cbf5285" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-2a4c247c-1fdf-4ea0-98c0-28fdfbb47673" facs="#m-84bd0532-42e8-4d36-aefc-78242c1fcd5b" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-63631f54-8255-4f98-8cd9-ac0b59f70667" facs="#m-b69c07e4-c65a-4c0e-9cba-4973efc61fa8" label="lyrics-like">AEX Dé-i éjus“ In córde ipsí-us. V. Et non</l><l xml:id="m-6cacf787-4035-4f1e-9d6c-a9cd4dd68f20" facs="#m-75d0d430-bd58-4ee3-aeff-0e55b3e32364" label="lyrics-like">supplantabúntur gréssus é-jus. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-db4bd97b-88a6-4e0e-99c4-1f1525b04fa0" facs="#m-fa19f948-1237-43ad-9841-02b228599614" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-84ca26bc-cf51-472b-a8db-b57a4e357153" facs="#m-3404450a-b7d0-48c5-97e2-8a995d86b226" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-3491e4fa-7f8e-4194-bffe-d590928fb582" facs="#m-e831939d-4dc3-4792-a1a4-929bdd33c73a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-6e8456eb-00a3-43b2-9947-4dc16a18ce8e" facs="#m-2a24bbdd-5171-42b2-a3be-36fe7f44bb09" label="lyrics-like">EX Dé-i éjus in córde ipsí-us:"Alle-lú-ia, al¬</l><l xml:id="m-8133e657-e043-4143-a3d4-a3b3af95f47c" facs="#m-89845ed1-cf40-4c26-839b-708f57175e50" label="lyrics-like">le-lú-ia. V. Et non supplantabúntur gréssus éjus. Gló-ri-a.</l><l xml:id="m-94762618-cd62-4016-a71a-74857b0a535d" facs="#m-d948be70-1863-4b2f-b612-710f4f64d076" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústum dedúxit Dóminus per vías réctas. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-c3fa3a50-7a5a-40dc-8f56-9194a36d33ea" facs="#m-8af19f69-73a3-40f2-bf9f-f15fdffa70f5" label="lyrics-like">K. Et osténdit illi régnum Déi. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-1b212015-026a-4647-a308-4438336d5eda" facs="#m-0bbed323-24e8-4511-aa60-1f0045b37dc0" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-e0f528b9-1fcb-46b7-96ed-3d49180689b8" facs="#m-72cf2d66-82f3-484c-bd0c-e97d7f5f2506" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. I. ga. p. 128. — 2. Confitébor. I. f. p. 133.</l><l xml:id="m-241f4df4-b3c2-4ded-ad44-69ab6c634d83" facs="#m-c0adc70c-42fe-4e8a-ab4a-7563f36bbf7f" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Beátus vir. 3. a. p. 142. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 7. a. p. 151. —</l><l xml:id="m-0789fa7a-72ae-4cd1-a7ee-11e203c0c6b5" facs="#m-c031d858-739e-46ae-9c8e-3afcc47710b5" label="lyrics-like">5. Laudâte Dóminum. 7. ca. p. 168.</l><l xml:id="m-f28ca28f-59af-4eba-9124-d1b6df780ed3" facs="#m-6161b27d-ba9a-47e4-ba64-5eab1ac00aa7" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-64939d8b-703a-4623-b31c-45a9e08f5ec3" facs="#m-56c0664a-e7e5-41c3-b49c-aa8ceda9ac19" label="ambiguous">1.g2</l><l xml:id="m-ecd9bffb-b5ea-45ff-aecc-00a31446320b" facs="#m-e6a68209-356f-4105-bf40-0dbf1ce91a51" label="lyrics-like">OOmine, “quinque ta-lénta tradidísti míhi: ec¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb8ae9d3-6c7f-4866-b98e-bb720240456b" facs="#m-f01f0f80-d97b-4144-a336-bfd4fb9bd56f" label="lyrics-like">ádi-a quinque</l><l xml:id="m-b1b610fa-3535-4c95-a0af-61ac695f8d10" facs="#m-68212b69-fc73-4340-8735-9eed9e5c14a6" label="lyrics-like">super-lucrátus sum. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-8459e396-3798-4a65-a7ec-b3d97f91e2a4" facs="#m-a3635c8c-f30e-4df7-8263-0fe2c4e15f52" label="ambiguous">ce</l><l xml:id="m-3be9fb14-356c-475a-bc35-654b74191226" facs="#m-3279a4f7-90e1-41b8-be47-99405d7d6ac9" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-f62b6df2-b79f-45ba-adf5-4d8820df2fa2" facs="#m-5c412613-dc3b-48dc-b35f-e752e929fa92" label="ambiguous">1.f</l><l xml:id="m-7a92649b-a1da-4b76-9303-ea476df0e45f" facs="#m-c96bf07b-fd36-4bd7-8018-46e3962bef1d" label="ambiguous">6</l><l xml:id="m-df353476-af1a-4673-b958-bb77ab552b32" facs="#m-155f9608-0172-47f4-ab1a-a4803411f8aa" label="lyrics-like">Uge sérve bóne,* in mó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e07582f-b0e7-4c35-a5ae-b84a1558fddc" facs="#m-e83f086b-714a-48de-a485-a8d26766ce75" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. Eu ou a e.</l></lg>
